; eww.yuck — RETIRED media-popup (BAR-04/D-18..25), removed 10-06
;
; The eww media popup was replaced by the AGS media applet (10-01..10-06):
; eww 0.6.0 on this Hyprland 0.55.4 build never delivered pointer clicks to
; any interactive widget (root cause:
; .planning/debug/resolved/eww-media-popup-clicks-dead.md), so no button/
; slider in the popup below ever worked. AGS (GTK4, gtk4-layer-shell) does
; receive clicks on this machine — see 10-02-SUMMARY.md's human-verified
; input-viability gate.
;
; The `media-popup`/`media-backdrop` defwindows and their supporting
; `media`/`media_players`/`media_switcher`/`media-center` declarations were
; removed here (10-06 Task 2) after confirming (grep across hypr/ and
; waybar/) that they were eww's only consumer — nothing else in this repo
; invokes the `eww` binary or opens any other eww window. The eww daemon
; was accordingly dropped from autostart.conf and `[templates.eww]` from
; matugen/config.toml. The eww package itself is left installed (harmless)
; per the plan's decision — only the autostart/window surface is retired.
;
; This file is intentionally left with no active defwindow/defwidget: it
; is kept (rather than deleted) as a placeholder + retirement record for
; the still-stowed eww/.config/eww/ package (eww.scss, assets/blank.png),
; which is out of this plan's declared file scope to remove.
